33,1,1,talk,Rin,,I don't know who the wolf is! I'm scared but brave!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree with Mizuki. Transparency helps the village.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
